Z||000014||sqoach||11-30-2001||10:19 PM||||Yeah, where do we fiero guys fit in? Looks like it's muscle cars vs. ricers. I would not call the fiero a muscle car, and it sure isn't an import ricer-mobile. We're stuck in the middle!<BR>Well, I'm not on either side myself. I just drive my fiero cuz I like it. I like some of the "riced out" imports as long as they don't over do it. And I like some of the old muscle cars. I'm a nuetral guy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>                <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigsqoach2.gif"> <BR><B>86 SE V6 - daily driver</B><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><LI>86 Sport Coupe 2.5L 5spd (soon to be sold)</FONT>||||reg||1
